WEBVTT

00:07:27.956 --> 00:07:31.356
that make them good partners
and customers for entrepreneurs.

00:07:31.356 --> 00:07:34.356
We know so much more
about climate injustice.

00:07:34.356 --> 00:07:37.636
We have real demand
from the public to solve it.

00:07:37.676 --> 00:07:40.916
We have engineers
and scientists and investors

00:07:40.956 --> 00:07:43.436
working around the planet
on these problems.

00:07:44.916 --> 00:07:46.276
Put these things together

00:07:46.276 --> 00:07:48.956
and a clear picture emerges,

00:07:48.996 --> 00:07:52.916
a realistic pathway
towards a clean future for all.

00:07:54.356 --> 00:07:56.556
These things have another characteristic.

00:07:56.596 --> 00:07:58.436
They are combinatorial.

00:07:58.436 --> 00:08:00.716
One accelerates the other.